menuconfig ENABLE_COMP_AI_AUDIO
    bool "enable ai audio playback orchestration"
    default n
    select ENABLE_AI_PLAYER
    help
        Enable the AI audio orchestration module (agent-core/ai_audio):
        TTS stream playback and music playlist playback on top of the
        audio_player component (svc_ai_player interface). Selects
        ENABLE_AI_PLAYER automatically.

        Note: the upstream input side (ai_audio_input, tdl_audio based) is
        NOT ported in this tree; the uplink audio path goes through the
        port contract instead (see examples/agent_demo). The upstream
        input-codec choice (PCM/OPUS/SPEEX) is therefore not restored
        either -- it only served the removed input side.

if (ENABLE_COMP_AI_AUDIO)
    choice AI_PLAYER_ALERT_SOURCE
        prompt "select player alert source"
        default AI_PLAYER_ALERT_SOURCE_LOCAL

        config AI_PLAYER_ALERT_SOURCE_LOCAL
            bool "use local alert source"
            help
                Phase 1 does not port the local alert assets (media_src.h
                LOCAL_ALERT_SRC_*, ~2MB); alerts are skipped with a warning.
                Phase 2 restores the assets.

        config AI_PLAYER_ALERT_SOURCE_CUSTOM
            bool "use custom alert source"
            help
                The application registers its own alert callback via
                ai_audio_player_reg_alert_cb().

    # 上游第三个选项 AI_PLAYER_ALERT_SOURCE_CLOUD 依赖已删除的
    # ai_agent_cloud_alert（③层公开面无消费者删除），故不恢复。

    endchoice
endif
